==Acquisition==
The mod can be bought from [[The Business]] for {{sc|20,000}} after reaching '''Rank 3 - Doer''' with [[Solaris United]].

==Notes==
*Despite the mod's description reading "over 50%", the buff will still be applied when the companion's crit chance is ''at 50%''. In other words, the companion's crit chance needs to be '''≥''' 50%.
*Does not affect [[Amp]] damage.
*Critical damage multiplier is a flat final and follows the formula 1 + (tier * (crit multi - 1 + final)) where the first tier is yellow (eg. skana multi is 1.5x which is brought to 2.7x (2.7x on yellow, 4.4x on orange, 6.1x on red and so on) the impact lessens depending on modded critical multiplier)
*The [[Robotic Weapons]] that can satisfy the critical chance requirements ''without'' [[Riven Mods]] are:
**{{Weapon|Prime Laser Rifle}}, {{Weapon|Vulcax}} and {{Weapon|Vulklok}} with {{M|Point Strike}}, {{Weapon|Laser Rifle}} with {{M|Critical Delay}}.
**{{Weapon|Burst Laser Prime}} and {{Weapon|Prisma Burst Laser}} with {{M|Primed Pistol Gambit}} or {{M|Creeping Bullseye}}.
*The [[Beast|Beast Companions]] that can satisfy the critical chance requirements are:
**All [[Kavat]]s and [[Vulpaphyla]]s with {{M|Bite}}.
**{{Companion|Huras Kubrow}} and {{Companion|Chesa Kubrow}} with {{M|Bite}}.
***The requirement can be satisfied by other [[Kubrow]]s and [[Predasite]]s using {{M|Hunter Synergy}} and a primary weapon with sufficient critical chance, depending on the breed.
