==Tips==
*{{WF|Harrow}} gets the most benefit from this mod, as his headshot-focused gameplay allows him to reliably trigger this mod's recovery reduction, and {{A|Covenant}} adds a flat critical chance bonus to all allies in Affinity Range, including companions, triggering the critical damage bonus for the duration of the ability as a result.
**{{WF|Cyte-09}} is a close second; though he cannot force crits through his innate abilities, he is also very Weak Point-oriented and his abilities synergize very well with this mod: {{A|Seek}} highlights heads and other Weak Point through walls and gives his weapons extra [[Punch Through]] while active, {{A|Evade}} allows him to remain invisible as long as he consistently makes Weak Point kills, and {{Weapon|Neutralizer}}'s ricochets aim for heads, sharply cutting down his companion's recovery time.
*{{WF|Khora}} can equip the mod on both her companion and {{A|Venari}} in order to receive double the normal bonus.

